msgid "Unsaved changes!"
msgstr "Guhertinên nehatine tomarkirin!"

msgid "Please select target plural by clicking."
msgstr "Tika ye bi tikandinê pirjimara armanc hilbijêre."

msgid "You have unsaved changes. Are you sure you want to skip?"
msgstr ""
"Guhertinên te yên nehatine tomarkirin hene. Tu piştrast î ku dixwazî derbas "
"bibî?"

